# @module examples.verify.euclid.book-i
# @means  Equal parallelograms on the same base are in the same parallels.
# @from   euclid — Elements, Book I, Proposition 35
# @tier   derived
# @needs  «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 25: parallelograms on the same base and parallels are equal»

theorem «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 35: equal parallelograms on the same base lie between parallels» () {
    assume parallelograms_ABCD_and_EBCF_equal_and_on_same_base_BC
    assume «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 25: parallelograms on the same base and parallels are equal»()
    therefore lines_AD_and_EF_are_parallel_to_BC
    therefore parallelograms_ABCD_EBCF_same_parallels
}